National Health Emergency) Amendment Determination 2022](https://www.legislation.gov.au/Details/F2022L00889) [F2022L00889]; and* >> >> *(b) the [Social Security (Qualification for Crisis Payment—National Health Emergency) Amendment Determination (No. 2) 2022](https://www.legislation.gov.au/Details/F2022L00993) [F2022L00993].* #### What does the Social Security (Qualification for Crisis Payment – National Health Emergency) Amendment Determination 2022 do? According to the [explanatory memorandum](https://www.legislation.gov.au/Details/F2022L00889/Explanatory%20Statement/Text): > *The purpose of this Determination is to add to the requirements a person must meet in order to qualify for crisis payment under the Social Security Act 1991 (the Act) in circumstances relating to the coronavirus known as COVID-19.* #### What does the Social Security (Qualification for Crisis Payment – National Health Emergency) Amendment Determination (No. 2) 2022 do? According to the [explanatory memorandum](https://www.legislation.gov.au/Details/F2022L00993/Explanatory%20Statement/Text): > *The purpose of this Determination is to extend until 30 September 2022 the period during which a requirement to quarantine or self-isolate may result in qualification for crisis payment under the Social Security Act 1991 (the Act) in circumstances relating to the coronavirus known as COVID-19.*","result":"negative","slug":"division-federal-senate-7770","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2022-09-28/1"}
